# Cloudflare Pages headers file. Has no effect locally — Pages applies it at the
# edge. Syntax: a path pattern on its own line, then indented "Name: value" lines.
#
# ⚠️ STRUCTURE: the CSP is deliberately NOT on /* any more. Two pages carry two
# different policies (the front door signs in, /todo must never gain JS), and a
# path that matched two CSP rules could end up with two CSP headers — which
# browsers enforce as the INTERSECTION, silently breaking sign-in. So /* carries
# only the non-CSP safety headers, and each page's CSP lives on its own exact
# rules. A NEW page added under public/ therefore ships with NO CSP until a rule
# is added here — add one, strict by default, in the same commit as the page.
#
# THE FRONT DOOR + /admin POLICY (estate-auth-design.md §7.2 — the old
# "zero external requests" rule was overturned WITH the reasoning on record;
# the in-file comment atop index.html carries it). Allow-listed, not open:
#   script-src  'self' + www.gstatic.com (Firebase SDK modules, the same CDN
#               builds every audiobook page ships) + apis.google.com (the
#               sign-in popup's helper — Google-controlled, needed by some
#               popup flows; remove if observed unused).
#   connect-src the two estate Workers (index = search, auth = the /admin
#               API whose CORS names exactly https://heygabi.ai) + Firebase
#               auth endpoints (identitytoolkit = sign-in, securetoken =
#               token refresh).
#   frame-src   the Firebase auth iframe on the project's authDomain, and
#               accounts.google.com for the sign-in flow.
#   img-src     'self' data: (the inline SVG favicon) + the estate's cover
#               hosts + the hosts catalog rows are known to hotlink
#               (openlibrary/books.google measured in the library; BGG
#               thumbnails for games) + Google avatars. A cover on any other
#               host renders blank (find.js hides broken images) — add the
#               host here if that starts mattering.
#   style-src   'self' (assets/estate-theme.css — the theme system) +
#               'unsafe-inline' for the per-page <style> blocks; with inline
#               SCRIPT still blocked there is no injection vector to
#               leverage a nonce against (unchanged reasoning).
#   font-src    'self' ONLY — every theme font (Rajdhani, Share Tech Mono,
#               Bangers, Luckiest Guy) is a committed woff2 under
#               assets/fonts/, the same no-third-party reasoning the games
#               repo used when it committed its own. Google Fonts hosts stay
#               OFF this list on purpose.
# Still absolutely absent: analytics, third-party font requests, CDN frameworks.
#
# /todo KEEPS THE ORIGINAL default-src 'none' NO-JS POLICY. Its filter is
# CSS-only radios and its README says it must never acquire JavaScript; the
# strict CSP is the enforcement of that sentence.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), interest-cohort=()

/
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self' https://www.gstatic.com https://apis.google.com; connect-src https://index.heygabi.ai https://auth.heygabi.ai https://identitytoolkit.googleapis.com https://securetoken.googleapis.com; img-src 'self' data: https://covers.heygabi.ai https://bookcovers.heygabi.ai https://covers.openlibrary.org https://books.google.com https://cf.geekdo-images.com https://lh3.googleusercontent.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self'; frame-src https://audiobook-catalog.firebaseapp.com https://accounts.google.com; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'

/admin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self' https://www.gstatic.com https://apis.google.com; connect-src https://index.heygabi.ai https://auth.heygabi.ai https://identitytoolkit.googleapis.com https://securetoken.googleapis.com; img-src 'self' data: https://covers.heygabi.ai https://bookcovers.heygabi.ai https://covers.openlibrary.org https://books.google.com https://cf.geekdo-images.com https://lh3.googleusercontent.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self'; frame-src https://audiobook-catalog.firebaseapp.com https://accounts.google.com; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'

